convertBoldToSBold
├── When caller, deadline, execution, amount or custody is invalid
│   └── It reverts
├── When caller minimum is zero or mint misses caller/canonical preview minimum
│   └── It atomically restores pending BOLD
├── When mint reports false deltas or no shares
│   └── It atomically reverts
└── When valid
    └── It converts classified BOLD only, credits actual sBOLD and clears approval
